SARWAR KE AZADAAR<br>
<br>
Maare gaye be jurm-o-qata Abid-e-Beemar &ndash; Sarwar ke azaadar<br>
Zehre dagha se dardo musibat me giraftar &ndash; Sarwar ke azaadar<br>
<br>
Pucha gaya shiddath ki musibat huwi kis jaa &ndash; Aaye sayyad-e-wala<br>
Ashsham kaha aapne roro ke kayee baar &ndash; Sarwar ke azaadar<br>
<br>
Chaalees baras baap ko rote huwe guzri &ndash; Bas yunhi basar ki<br>
Ab tak bhi jise kehte hai sab abid-e-beemar &ndash; Sarwar ke azaadar<br>
<br>
Zainab ke sakina ke the bas tumhi sahare &ndash; The dard ke maare<br>
Har waqt rahe ranj-o-masayeb mein ye ghamkhwar &ndash; Sarwar ke azaadar<br>
<br>
Zindaa&rsquo;n ke andhere sejo ghabrati thi nadaa&rsquo;n &ndash; Khud hote the girya<br>
Jab bali Sakina ko rulate the sitamgaar &ndash; Sarwar ke azaadar<br>
<br>
Wo kaunsi aafat hai jo unpar nahi aayi &ndash; The haq ke fidaai<br>
The ranj-o-mehan, tauq-o-salasal mein giraftaar &ndash; Sarwar ke azaadar<br>
<br>
Qasim bhi bade dard se kehta hai ye nauha &ndash; Aye kul ke masiha<br>
Usko bhi shifa dijiye aye abid-e-beemar &ndash; Sarwar ke azaadar
